help.chordpro:
ChordPro quick syntax:
- Chords inline: [C]Amazing [G]grace
- Title directive: {title: My Song}
- Key directive: {key: G}
- Artist directive: {artist: My Band}
- Tags directive: {tags: worship, acoustic}

Example:
{title: Amazing Grace}
{key: G}
[G]Amazing [C]grace how [G]sweet the [D]sound
